# =============================================================================
# SupportDesk AI — FRONTEND environment variables (EXAMPLE)
# =============================================================================
# Copy to `.env` if you need to override the default:
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# IMPORTANT: every VITE_* variable is inlined into the JavaScript bundle and is
# therefore PUBLIC. Anyone can read it in devtools. Never put an API key, a JWT
# secret, or a database password in this file. Secrets belong in backend/.env.
# =============================================================================

# Base URL for API calls.
#
# Leave EMPTY in development: requests then go to /api/... on the Vite dev
# server, which proxies them to the backend (see vite.config.ts). Same-origin,
# so no CORS involved.
#
# Set it in production to the deployed API origin, e.g.
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.supportdesk.example.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
